Output assets/demo.gif
Output assets/demo.mp4

Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1200
Set Height 680
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 40ms

Type "# 1. Legacy linear scan: ripgrep across 63,000 files in /usr/include"
Enter
Sleep 600ms
Type "time rg 'pthread' /usr/include | wc -l"
Enter
Sleep 1800ms

Type "# 2. 2026 Agentic Architecture: poler L1–L3 Content-Addressed Crystal (.t5a)"
Enter
Sleep 600ms
Type "time poler harvest /usr/include 'pthread' address | wc -l"
Enter
Sleep 2200ms

Type "# 3. Instant 1-line install (Linux & macOS):"
Enter
Sleep 400ms
Type "curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Kotokvit/poler-cli/main/install.sh | bash"
Enter
Sleep 3000ms
